{"id":"u-7328f3c5-04de-4fd1-8a98-e2d3a8bf12c2","src":"community","title":"EA-14","author":"atif","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/mdINQs-ea-14-1","desc":"EA-14 — Engineered Aesthetic 14\n\nA 14-day hypertrophy cycle engineered specifically for aesthetic physique development.\n\nEA-14 uses an 8-session rotation across 14 days rather than a conventional 7-day split. The structure separates major pushing and pulling sessions to minimize within-workout fatigue interference, while using dedicated lower-body and specialization sessions to distribute volume without compromising performance.\n\nThe program prioritizes:\n\n- Maximum productive hypertrophy volume\n- Shoulder-to-waist ratio and V-taper\n- Lateral delts, lats, upper back, chest and arms\n- Complete lower-body development\n- Direct abdominal development\n- High-quality execution and progression\n- High stimulus-to-fatigue efficiency\n- Balanced proportions and an athletic, natural-looking physique\n\nTraining is performed with a combination of stable machines, cables, Smith-machine work and strategically selected free-weight movements. Most isolation work is trained close to failure, while heavier compound movements retain slightly more RIR to preserve performance and recovery.\n\nSchedule: 8 sessions / 14 days\nGoal: Aesthetic hypertrophy\nMethod: High-quality volume + progressive overload + fatigue management\nCycle length: 14 days","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-28T05:21:28.353Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push A","Pull A","Lower B","Special B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":20,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","s